Package: shadshiny
Title: 'shadcn/ui' Components for 'Shiny'
Version: 0.3.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Arijit", "Ghosh", email = "arijitghosh2009@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A broad, experimental reimplementation of the 'shadcn/ui' design
    system for 'Shiny' applications: 73 accessible, themeable components --
    including semantic
    field composition primitives and a
    full-featured data table, questionnaire workflow, layout and page-shell primitives, dashboard
    value boxes, sparklines and chart theming, keyboard/code/scroll/shimmer
    utility elements, and a server-side form validator,
    custom and registry-imported themes, and a streaming chat module --
    implemented in framework-free CSS and vanilla
    JavaScript, wrapped as native R functions with 'Shiny' input bindings.
    Coexists with 'Bootstrap 5' and 'bslib', including automatic dark-mode
    synchronization.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
